<title>ITALY: Italy's IRI studies offers for Stet unit.</title>
<headline>Italy's IRI studies offers for Stet unit.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1996-10-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Italian state industrial holding IRI said on Wednesday it had received 26 valid offers for the publishing arm of telecom holding Stet, which it would now study.</p>
<p>IRI said 20 of the offers for publishing division Seat had come from foreign companies and six from Italian firms. The Italian government has demanded that Seat be sold off before Stet's privatisation, which is slated for the Spring of 1997.</p>
</text>
